    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076410/extras/eaf3c76cdafdc72a61358c5149f3e25d.avif?t=1736357377\" width=616 height=260 /></span><br><br><strong>Step into the role of a medieval lord</strong> in <i>Castleyard</i>, an immersive castle management game where your strategic decisions shape the fate of the realm.<br><br><strong>Navigate the delicate balance of power</strong>\u2014your decisions will impact the loyalty of your Council, the favor of your people, and the prominence of your kingdom.<br><br><strong>Manage resources, train knights, and fortify your castle </strong>as you prepare for threats from both beyond and within the castle gates.<br><br><strong>Ride to glory in exhilarating tournaments and lead your realm to greatness!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076410/extras/aa8920b0302ddca9c3ca2cf051d4cc86.avif?t=1736357377\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076410/extras/c54ed79f10549de7ff13af7fecc29d32.poster.avif?t=1736357377\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076410/extras/c54ed79f10549de7ff13af7fecc29d32.webm?t=1736357377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076410/extras/c54ed79f10549de7ff13af7fecc29d32.mp4?t=1736357377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Navigate an evolving storyline where your choices influence your character traits.<br></li><li>  Depending on your decisions, new branching storylines may develop or fizzle out.<br></li><li>  Encounter dynamic story events including diplomatic conflicts and internal plots that require your strategic input.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076410/extras/31c1a782427c8a966b040d6ec3835cd8.avif?t=1736357377\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076410/extras/ec976b32355ab6843d86a184f12e8656.poster.avif?t=1736357377\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076410/extras/ec976b32355ab6843d86a184f12e8656.webm?t=1736357377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076410/extras/ec976b32355ab6843d86a184f12e8656.mp4?t=1736357377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interact with a dynamic Council dialogue system, building trust and deep relationships, each with their own unique traits and loyalties.<br></li><li>Oversee the construction and upgrading of essential buildings such as the manor, church, farms, tournament grounds, archery range, and tavern.<br></li><li>Balance the management of resources like gold, food, piety, influence, and favor to maintain your realm\u2019s stability.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076410/extras/e31b3efe6dc12b8cf8d74f2bd19c9f36.avif?t=1736357377\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076410/extras/997ba6006df65e3dd0ebec1a4df247d9.poster.avif?t=1736357377\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076410/extras/997ba6006df65e3dd0ebec1a4df247d9.webm?t=1736357377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076410/extras/997ba6006df65e3dd0ebec1a4df247d9.mp4?t=1736357377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Test your skills and gain favor through jousting and archery tournaments.<br></li><li> Guide your knights training, equipment, and trusty steed.<br></li><li>Reap the rewards of victory and bolster your realm\u2019s standing.</li></ul><br><strong>Own your adventure, lead your people, and shape the destiny of your medieval <i>Castleyard</i>!</strong><br><br><br>Inspired by the efforts of other small indie projects, this game is a passion project started by a solo developer.  Feel free to reach out to share opinions, ideas, and criticisms - I welcome any feedback.",
